# Rule Generator

- When asked to create a new rule:
  - Generate a properly formatted .mdc file
  - Use consistent naming convention (###-category-name.mdc)
  - Include appropriate front matter (description, globs, alwaysApply)
  - Structure content with clear sections and bullet points
  - Save to .cursor/rules/ directory

- Rule categories:
  - 000-099: Core/Meta rules
  - 100-199: Architecture and design rules
  - 200-299: API integration rules
  - 300-399: Testing and quality rules
  - 400-499: Deployment and infrastructure rules

- When updating existing rules:
  - Preserve front matter structure
  - Maintain consistent formatting
  - Document changes in rule content